          "type": "output_text",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": [],
          "text": "{\"occurrence_id\":\"verona-colei-che-non-si-deve-amare-1049b6906b4e0314\",\"core_classification\":{\"label_support\":{\"truth_conditional\":4,\"performative\":1,\"exclamatory_reflexive\":0,\"other\":0},\"confidence\":0.95,\"analysis\":\"Rafa directly avows that he loves Loretta and has done so increasingly for months. The utterance is predominantly truth-conditional: it presents his enduring emotional state as true. Its use to deny that she will simply be replaced gives weak support to an implicit relational undertaking, but reassurance and courtship do not establish strong performative force. The heated repetition supplies no independent evidence of expressive/reflex-like discharge.\",\"ambiguity\":\"There is limited P/T ambiguity because Rafa invokes his love while proposing an ongoing arrangement and denying Loretta's replaceability; nevertheless, the highlighted clause itself primarily avows a state rather than making a commitment.\"},\"other_diagnosis\":{\"tpe_failure\":null,\"core_not_context\":null},\"utterance_status\":{\"status\":\"direct\",\"description\":\"Rafa addresses Loretta in direct dialogue; the highlighted “ti amo” occurs within the complement “Non hai compreso ancora che ti amo” (“Have you still not understood that I love you”).\"},\"contextual_interpretation\":\"Rafa offers the avowal as a rebuttal to Loretta's suspicion that she will be replaced by another mistress. He portrays his love as longstanding, intensifying, and powerful enough to override prudence, then presses her to accept his proposal. His pleading, repetition, and passionate conduct intensify the avowal but do not independently make it reflexive/expressive. The broader scene also shows coercive physical pressure and Loretta's resistance, which complicate the encounter without changing the core utterance's dominant T force.\",\"evidence\":[{\"evidence_id\":\"E1\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"“Non hai compreso ancora che ti amo, che ti amo da lunghi mesi, ogni giorno più forte?”\",\"supports\":\"Strong T: Rafa explicitly presents love as an enduring emotional state that has grown over several months.\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"evidence_id\":\"E2\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Loretta suggests that “another” woman will replace her; Rafa answers, “Un’altra? Questa parola non ha senso!”\",\"supports\":\"The avowal reassures her of claimed uniqueness and constancy, creating only weak P pressure because no explicit commitment is made by the core clause.\",\"confidence\":0.93},{\"evidence_id\":\"E3\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Rafa says he no longer can reflect, fears no danger, and repeatedly asks Loretta to say yes.\",\"supports\":\"The utterance belongs to urgent courtship and persuasion, but urgency and emotional intensity alone do not establish E or strong P.\",\"confidence\":0.97},{\"evidence_id\":\"E4\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Later narration describes Rafa's passionate eyes and pleading voice as he kneels before Loretta.\",\"supports\":\"Confirms intense delivery while providing no positive indication that “ti amo” was an involuntary or reflex-like verbal discharge.\",\"confidence\":0.94},{\"evidence_id\":\"E5\",\"source\":\"supplied_metadata\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"The occurrence is marked as affirmative present-tense Italian “ti amo” and reviewed as VALID_EXPLICIT_LOVE_I_YOU.\",\"supports\":\"Confirms that the target is an explicit present-form love utterance rather than an incidental lexical match.\",\"confidence\":0.99}],\"background_knowledge\":{\"used\":false,\"familiarity\":\"none\",\"confidence\":null,\"contribution\":null},\"ontology_assessment\":{\"fit\":\"natural\",\"diagnosis\":\"T naturally captures the core avowal; a low P score registers its limited role in implying constancy within Rafa's proposal. Intensity, persuasion, and coercive context require contextual description but reveal no missing dimension of core force.\",\"candidate_recurrent_dimension\":null},\"notes\":null}"
